    "summary": "Once per battle, the bearer can call down a strike along a line between markers. Only a **CAPTAIN** model may take it.\n\n1. As one of your Shooting phases begins, you may mark any point on the battlefield.\n2. As your next Shooting phase begins, add a second marker up to 12\" from the first marker's centre, then join their centres with a straight line.\n3. Each unit the line goes over or through takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** if a D6 rolled for it shows 3+.\n4. Take both markers away.",
